  "created": "2026-11-22T07:37:53.113Z",
  "description": "gnuplot 6.0.5 for win-x64, cut down to about 21 MB for headless use: gnuplot.exe and the DLLs it loads, with Qt, wxWidgets, libheif, libavif and libtiff replaced by stub DLLs. File terminals (svg, pngcairo, pdfcairo, ...) work; the interactive qt and wxt terminals do not. The files are copied to gnuplot\\bin\\ in the output directory. Start gnuplot.exe with GNUTERM set to a file terminal, for example svg.",
